<p>There are many different types of lighting and light combinations that can be placed in the editor.
</p><p>There are also many tools used to create lighting and generate lighting and even visualize lighting in the editor.  The goal with the editor is to give the artist the same experience as he/she would see in the game.  This will help them to be able to create the levels and tweak lighting quickly without having to stop to see it in-game.
</p><p><br />
</p>
